A sudden realization:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l007","ordinal":377575,"en":"\"I can knock Akjoltoy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l008","ordinal":377576,"en":"Look at your number."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l009","ordinal":377577,"en":"It's tiresome to ride in the desert,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l010","ordinal":377578,"en":"Steel hooves horse."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l011","ordinal":377579,"en":"Don't let the kick fall off the ground,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l012","ordinal":377580,"en":"Steel falcon."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l013","ordinal":377581,"en":"Dear friend Akjoltoy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l014","ordinal":377582,"en":"You brought Kulansur."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l015","ordinal":377583,"en":"Iron hoof, cymbal,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l016","ordinal":377584,"en":"Dark blue without sweat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l017","ordinal":377585,"en":"Let him ride in the carriage, he said."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l018","ordinal":377586,"en":"Let Kajibai go into the forest - saying,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l019","ordinal":377587,"en":"Let him ride without worry."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l020","ordinal":377588,"en":"Let him straighten his back and say,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l021","ordinal":377589,"en":"Kakanda is from Black China"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l022","ordinal":377590,"en":"Let's chase the day by knocking,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l023","ordinal":377591,"en":"I can talk to you!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l024","ordinal":377592,"en":"From the fairy who came to Kazanat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l025","ordinal":377593,"en":"A horse came from the fairy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l026","ordinal":377594,"en":"The bulletproof vest came"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l027","ordinal":377595,"en":"God Almighty is ahead"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l028","ordinal":377596,"en":"God gives abundantly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l029","ordinal":377597,"en":"Akjoltoy, who is black"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l030","ordinal":377598,"en":"The shadow of the palace supports the number,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l031","ordinal":377599,"en":"He took me with him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1048:b002:l032","ordinal":377600,"en":"He did a great job."}]
